lofibox (0.2.7-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 0.2.7.
  * Add a native Wayland desktop-widget target for compositor-managed
    Cardputer Zero sessions while retaining the framebuffer target for
    legacy APPLaunch launches.
  * Let the Cardputer Zero APPLaunch wrapper choose Wayland, X11, or
    framebuffer at runtime and enable the LoFiBox WebUI by default for the
    appliance launch profile.
  * Show the started WebUI address in Settings even when the host
    connectivity probe reports offline.

 -- LoFiBox contributors <maintainers@example.invalid>  Sat, 23 May 2026 00:00:00 +0800

lofibox (0.2.6-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 0.2.6.
  * Observe Linux PCM decoder/sink child-process exit while pipe reads are
    pending, and pause instead of queue-advancing when a reliable backend
    finish position remains materially before the known duration.
  * Verify default Linux WebUI smoke coverage in CI.

 -- LoFiBox contributors <maintainers@example.invalid>  Fri, 22 May 2026 02:55:00 +0800

lofibox (0.2.5-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 0.2.5.
  * Gate automatic queue advance on playback position instead of trusting
    early backend Finished states.
  * Realtime-throttle local Linux PCM decoding and reduce local Linux
    track-switch latency.
  * Build WebUI by default on Linux and show its address in Settings while
    network status is online.

 -- LoFiBox contributors <maintainers@example.invalid>  Thu, 21 May 2026 20:15:00 +0800

lofibox (0.2.4-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 0.2.4.
  * Collapse GUI/device playback-mode shortcuts to one cycle and label audio
    effects as REMIX MODE.
  * Treat standard Linux evdev direction key events as the only direction
    source; ordinary letter key events remain character input.

 -- LoFiBox contributors <maintainers@example.invalid>  Thu, 21 May 2026 19:00:00 +0800

lofibox (0.2.3-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 0.2.3.
  * Resolve Linux runtime paths and the default local media root from the
    effective user's account home when HOME is unset, keeping APPLaunch and
    service-style starts aligned with shell commands for the same user.
  * Best-effort refresh a running instance after direct CLI local-root
    add/remove/enable/disable commands.

 -- LoFiBox contributors <maintainers@example.invalid>  Thu, 21 May 2026 18:30:00 +0800

lofibox (0.2.2-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 0.2.2.
  * Persist local media roots through SourceProfilesDomain local-root profiles
    with source and library CLI command surfaces.
  * Default unconfigured local library startup to ~/Music through application
    services, including /root/Music when HOME=/root.
  * Add runtime library-refresh for running-instance configured-root rescans.
  * Fix Windows/MSVC UTF-8 source compilation and curl helper lookup.

 -- LoFiBox contributors <maintainers@example.invalid>  Thu, 21 May 2026 00:00:00 +0800

lofibox (0.2.1-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Fix Cardputer Zero APPLaunch startup through a wrapper that inherits
    APPLaunch framebuffer and keyboard device paths with ST7789V fallback
    detection.
  * Install a Cardputer-sized APPLaunch icon instead of linking the 180x180
    hicolor desktop icon.
  * Keep /usr/lib/lofibox/lofibox_zero_device stable for APPLaunch across
    Linux device build configurations.

